he juicy red apples","x":0.042222233746717526,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"h":0.013149027143205982,"w":0.36222221374511721,"y":0.59011627896132934,"text":"into the classroom and the children quickly agreed 3","x":0.039999999710774857},{"text":"they would be delicious to eat. What Rosie failed to tell them at","x":0.042222230723822883,"y":0.60448979608500852,"w":0.4377777481079102,"h":0.011836734693877471},{"x":0.039892837795320268,"y":0.6162233056384091,"h":0.013374323942223376,"text":"this point, however, was that she 4","w":0.2424819564819336},{"w":0.11333333015441893,"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.36888889207093867,"y":0.61755102025057451,"text":"dropped one of"},{"w":0.33555553436279301,"y":0.63061224504598556,"x":0.040000005003788884,"text":"the apples on the floor and it was badly bruised.","h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.013197674653968039,"y":0.64680232520042813,"x":0.042222225633418591,"w":0.43555553436279298,"text":"When the teacher held the dropped apple up for all to see and"},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.042222233996717547,"w":0.43333332061767577,"text":"described it as disgusting and nasty the children were confused.","y":0.66122448984092563},{"w":0.16,"h":0.01315733306261968,"text":"She then encouraged 5","y":0.67296511595260844,"x":0.040000001777777745},{"y":0.67587209288692307,"text":"to pass the apple around","w":0.18444444656372072,"x":0.27555555444769936,"h":0.010250356246014003},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"the class and to abuse it, 6","w":0.18888887405395507,"x":0.040000010565614946,"y":0.68604651172697395},{"x":0.30888889262335878,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"the majority of children","y":0.68734693882612763,"w":0.16666666030883792},{"w":0.35111110687255859,"y":0.70040816338541045,"x":0.040000007971127897,"text":"began to do: Aren't you ugly? You taste horrible, ?","h":0.013254627305634203},{"x":0.039825834495357954,"y":0.71359098515408281,"w":0.26033308029174806,"h":0.013671225722955205,"text":"you? One girl, however, objected to 8"},{"w":0.093333330154418914,"x":0.38444444720056831,"text":"unkind things","y":0.71656976764987534,"h":0.010369007733403324},{"h":0.010208827427455325,"w":0.13111110687255861,"text":"like her classmates.","y":0.72816326528967512,"x":0.04000000343038735},{"y":0.74273255781307357,"x":0.040000001472222199,"h":0.013185809388452596,"w":0.14000000000000001,"text":"Rosie then passed?"},{"h":0.011627906487912454,"y":0.74563953520081117,"text":"other apple around and the","w":0.19333332061767577,"x":0.26444444838560666},{"y":0.75714285706087525,"w":0.21777776718139649,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"children in the class this time 10","x":0.040000008927820158},{"y":0.75999999991820943,"h":0.010348836937729144,"text":"urged to show","x":0.34222222246813955,"w":0.10444444656372071},{"text":"kindness and say compassionate things to the apple. Rosie then","h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.4377777481079102,"y":0.77180232578947394,"x":0.040000020307155888},{"y":0.78326530616720136,"w":0.068888888359069825,"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"held up 11","x":0.040000000848242845},{"x":0.1800000026911622,"h":0.010174418079609837,"w":0.29333332061767581,"y":0.78633720961935205,"text":"of the apples and recalled the positive and"},{"text":"negative things the children had said. But both apples looked alike.","y":0.79795918354992268,"w":0.43555553436279293,"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.040000017855640307},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"What Rosie did then was intended 12","x":0.040000008520412786,"w":0.25777776718139644,"y":0.81387755111960269},{"x":0.38653285235424872,"w":0.082489852905273442,"text":"bring about","y":0.81637873913758607,"h":0.011137870477170297},{"x":0.040000019493435061,"h":0.013144281348403619,"y":0.82848837195430414,"w":0.40666664123535157,"text":"a sharp moment of realisation to the class of young pupils."},{"w":0.17185647964477541,"y":0.84140612370947587,"x":0.039565211255928559,"text":"She cut the apples open.","h":0.013385923735949379},{"w":0.41777778625488282,"x":0.039999999242928935,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"Rosie drew the children's attention to how the abused apple","y":0.85901162807871811},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"was all damaged inside. She explained: people 13","x":0.040000002191162204,"y":0.87209302357290408,"w":0.33333332061767573},{"x":0.039871657585862155,"text":"are bullied feel terrible but we often don't see the damage.","y":0.883938665238168,"w":0.40694240570068363,"h":0.014467105476223652},{"text":"We wouldn't know how much pain we have caused the apple","h":0.013997829982212662,"y":0.89821878322243176,"x":0.0398809795328329,"w":0.42688232421874994},{"x":0.037777778011300549,"h":0.0072674412630042706,"text":"14","y":0.91133720967373044,"w":0.017777776718139654},{"y":0.91424418638170668,"h":0.010245609672702161,"w":0.17333332061767576,"x":0.14000000346893998,"text":"we looked on the inside."},{"x":0.028642812702113857,"text":"176","y":0.95606929941317209,"w":0.040492153167724615,"h":0.013733494038484451},{"text":"3 Choose the correct option.","x":0.52222222522222206,"y":0.063953488190980567,"h":0.013189368734554341,"w":0.2400000000000001},{"x":0.53555555490113671,"y":0.097383721527820932,"h":0.017441859342613997,"w":0.30666666030883794,"text":"Coffee is good - but how good?"},{"text":"'Unless \/ Suppose \/ Provided you woke up in the morning to","h":0.013238016245316508,"x":0.53777777876144739,"y":0.1206395346662712,"w":0.41777778625488282},{"h":0.013153772938008235,"y":0.13510204112391822,"w":0.42000000000000004,"text":"discover you were out of coffee. Would you immediately run","x":0.53777778302777757},{"text":"to the shops?","w":0.095600147247314471,"x":0.5377554828570793,"y":0.1496396958345565,"h":0.013220608769630937},{"y":0.16715116246423634,"text":"Many people claim that coffee is the only thing 2who \/ - \/ that","x":0.53777778906043816,"h":0.01325700098154492,"w":0.42444442749023448},{"y":0.18313953505546232,"text":"gets their bodies working and their minds functioning every","x":0.53777778930227316,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.4133333206176758},{"text":"morning. For 3another I the other I others it's a loyal friend","y":0.19572246969238061,"h":0.015361986744160561,"w":0.41132080078125,"x":0.53766577972849217},{"x":0.53765060234413653,"y":0.2093777047344817,"h":0.014519281192701627,"w":0.32696472167968749,"text":"essential in helping to make it through the day."},{"h":0.013115804244061002,"x":0.53777779693787953,"text":"Fortunately, for those of us that can't get enough of this","y":0.22816326561365041,"w":0.38666664123535155},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.24273255831127627,"w":0.38666664123535155,"x":0.53777779532676862,"text":"bitter-tasting bean, it has 4many \/ few \/ plenty beneficial"},{"w":0.39333332061767579,"h":0.011836734693877471,"y":0.25714285714808471,"x":0.53777778806893994,"text":"effects on our health too. Back in 2006, for example, one"},{"text":"research project assured \/ suggested \/ urged that drinking","x":0.53777778864595971,"w":0.40222221374511724,"y":0.27180232563647477,"h":0.013095633837641341},{"w":0.4288888931274415,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"just one cup of coffee a day could prevent a certain liver disease.","x":0.53555555879739014,"y":0.2863372095104042},{"x":0.53999999743627936,"text":"A later study revealed that people who drank between three","y":0.30367346966009301,"h":0.013186995837153215,"w":0.40888889312744148},{"w":0.395555534362793,"x":0.53555555955934453,"y":0.31831395339810264,"h":0.013114617795360384,"text":"and five cups of coffee a day greatly reduced the chances"},{"h":0.013094447388940944,"w":0.41777778625488282,"text":"°to 1- 1 of developing Alzheimer's or dementia. Furthermore,","x":0.5355555461503364,"y":0.33139534851074792},{"h":0.013765733679946601,"y":0.34528340227375764,"text":"neurological studies 'insist \/ convince \/ warn that drinking","w":0.40463333129882817,"x":0.53548559934582551},{"text":"coffee can also prevent depression.","y":0.36191860494402817,"x":0.5355555599585867